      "id": "empty_direct_outbound_download_detour",
      "kind": "semantic",
      "semantic": "empty_direct_as_download_detour",
      "deprecated_in": "1.11.0",
      "path": "",
      "replacement": "给下载用的 direct 出站加 domain_resolver（或 bind_interface / inet4_bind_address / routing_mark 等），或改走 Proxy；只写 {\"type\":\"direct\",\"tag\":\"direct\"} 的空 direct 不能作为规则集下载 detour",
      "doc": "https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box/blob/dev/common/dialer/detour.go",
      "note": "check 完全静默，只有 run 启动规则集时才会 FATAL: detour to an empty direct outbound makes no sense。protocol/direct/outbound.go 用 reflect.DeepEqual(DialerOptions, {UDPFragmentDefault:true}) 判定 isEmpty"
    },
    {
      "id": "new_dns_optimistic_cache",
      "kind": "new",
      "since": "1.14.0",
      "title": "乐观 DNS 缓存（optimistic DNS cache）",
      "path": "dns.optimistic",
      "expect": "present",
      "adopt": "yes",
      "reason": "启用。缓存条目过期但仍在窗口（默认 3d）内时先返回旧值、后台刷新，对移动端「切网后第一次请求要等 DNS」的体感有直接改善。官方文档明确它与 disable_cache / disable_expire 冲突，本仓库两份都没用，无冲突。",
      "keywords": [
        "optimistic dns cache",
        "optimistic"
      ],
      "inventory": "docs/evidence/2026-10-13-features-1.14.0-inventory.md",
      "doc": "https://sing-box.sagernet.org/configuration/dns/#optimistic"
    },
    {
      "id": "new_udp_nat_max",
      "kind": "new",
      "since": "1.14.0",
      "title": "UDP NAT 会话上限（udp_nat_max）",
      "path": "inbounds[type=tun].udp_nat_max",
      "expect": "present",
      "adopt": "yes",
      "reason": "启用（只定上限）。官方默认行为是未设或为 0 时「iOS 用 4096，其他平台按内存总量在 4096–16384 之间取，探测不到内存时用 16384」，也就是不写就没有上限。本仓库显式写 4096，给非 iOS 平台加一道内存上限，对应历史上那次 Android 端内存占用冲到 1GB 的事故方向。同段引入的 udp_mapping / udp_filtering 保持官方默认（endpoint_independent），不写。",
      "keywords": [
        "udp nat options",
        "udp_nat_max",
        "udp_mapping",
        "udp_filtering"
      ],
      "inventory": "docs/evidence/2026-10-13-features-1.14.0-inventory.md",
      "doc": "https://sing-box.sagernet.org/configuration/shared/udp-nat/"
    },
    {
      "id": "new_tun_sing_tun_stack",
      "kind": "new",
      "since": "1.15.0",
      "title": "sing-tun 自带 TCP/IP 栈（取代 tun.stack）",
      "path": "inbounds[type=tun].stack",
      "expect": "absent",
      "adopt": "must",
      "decide_by": "1.17.0",
      "reason": "这不是「要不要开」而是「旧写法要删」：1.15 起 sing-tun 使用自己的 TCP/IP 栈，官方称峰值性能/能耗/内存均显著改善；删掉 stack 字段即启用。1.15/1.16 上删不删都能跑，1.17.0 起保留 stack 会 FATAL。",
      "keywords": [
        "tcp/ip stack",
        "sing-tun"
      ],
      "doc": "https://sing-box.sagernet.org/migration/#migrate-tun-stack",
      "follow_up": [
        {
          "todo": "换 sing-tun 自带栈后重新确认 inbounds[type=tun].mtu 取值",
          "when": "升级到 1.15.0 正式版时（官方对比表用 1500/4064/65535，本仓库现为 9000）"
        }
      ],
      "note": "迁移时另有附加待办，见 follow_up 字段（门禁 code matrix_follow_up_reminder，详见 docs/LESSONS.md L26）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "new_dns_server_address_rule_item",
      "kind": "new",
      "since": "1.15.0",
      "title": "route/dns 规则项 dns_server_address 与 dns_search_domain",
      "path": "**.dns_server_address",
      "expect": "absent",
      "adopt": "no",
      "reason": "可匹配系统/DHCP/VPN 下发的 DNS 服务器地址与搜索域；本仓库 DNS 已按域名分流，用不上。选择不启用。",
      "keywords": [
        "dns_server_address",
        "dns_search_domain"
      ],
      "doc": "https://sing-box.sagernet.org/configuration/route/rule/#dns_server_address"
    },
    {
      "id": "new_tls_certificate_sha256_pinning",
      "kind": "new",
      "since": "1.15.0",
      "title": "TLS 整证书 SHA-256 固定（certificate_sha256 / client_certificate_sha256）",
      "path": "**.tls.certificate_sha256",
      "expect": "absent",
      "adopt": "no",
      "reason": "在既有公钥固定之外新增整证书哈希固定。本仓库节点由用户随时更换、证书会轮换，钉死证书哈希会导致换证书后连不上，收益为负。选择不启用。",
      "keywords": [
        "certificate_sha256",
        "certificate pinning"
      ],
      "doc": "https://sing-box.sagernet.org/configuration/shared/tls/#certificate_sha256"
    },
    {
      "id": "new_cache_file_write_buffering",
      "kind": "new",
      "since": "1.15.0",
      "title": "cache_file 写缓冲（buffer_size / flush_interval）",
      "path": "experimental.cache_file.buffer_size",
      "expect": "absent",
      "adopt": "no",
      "reason": "纯 I/O 优化，默认 1MB 已由内核内部生效；即便不写字段，写缓冲这层也是开着的。额外调参无收益。选择不写字段。",
      "keywords": [
        "cache file write buffering",
        "buffer_size"
      ],
      "doc": "https://sing-box.sagernet.org/configuration/experimental/cache-file/#buffer_size"
    },
    {
      "id": "new_tun_auto_redirect_android",
      "kind": "new",
      "since": "1.15.0",
      "title": "Android auto_redirect 全功能支持",
      "path": "inbounds[type=tun].auto_redirect",
      "expect": "absent",
      "adopt": "no",
      "reason": "1.15 起 Android 上通过图形客户端的 root 服务或 root shell 全功能支持。本仓库三平台走 VpnService/系统 TUN，未使用 auto_redirect（也不需要 root）。无 root 真机验证条件，按默认策略选择不启用。",
      "keywords": [
        "auto_redirect"
      ],
      "doc": "https://sing-box.sagernet.org/configuration/inbound/tun/#auto_redirect",
      "note": "该字段本身自 1.10 起存在；1.15 是 Android 上的『全功能支持』。检测字段是 auto_redirect。"
    },
    {
      "id": "new_endpoint_on_demand",
      "kind": "new",
